    "created_at": "2025-05-29T01:33:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-29T01:33:51Z",
    "body": "Add minimal OpenQASM 3 export with symbolic variable support\n\n- Implemented convert_to_open_qasm_3 to export circuits to OpenQASM 3 format.\n- Symbolic variables in circuits are now exported as QASM 3 let float declarations.\n- Standard gates (H, Ry, CNOT, etc.) are exported in QASM 3 syntax, including support for single controls using ctrl @.\n- This enables round-trip export of circuits with primitive symbolic variables, as requested.\n- QASM 3 import and advanced symbolic expression support are not yet implemented.\"",
